ic ponies and homing mother\u2019s slippers, making combat both chaotic and fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/a522a9f90c96fd2b367e1b8b3d766317.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/a522a9f90c96fd2b367e1b8b3d766317.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=596 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.poster.avif?t=1772569089\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.webm?t=1772569089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/2e708eac454e0d72b479b48cb87dc92f.mp4?t=1772569089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/f891ac9c8d481d8535f50e27d3dd147d.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/f891ac9c8d481d8535f50e27d3dd147d.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/118c2e5c184289af1728859c16627abb.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/118c2e5c184289af1728859c16627abb.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be over<strong> 300</strong> different items across multiple tiers: Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic, Legendary, and Mythic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features around <strong>20</strong> primary stats and over <strong>20</strong> secondary stats, with items covering all possible attribute combinations. On top of that, there will be unique items across various tiers that provide powerful upgrades, allowing for even crazier builds and gameplay possibilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/a5234177c9a2285cf2c32e4d4380abf1.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/a5234177c9a2285cf2c32e4d4380abf1.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=665 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/1c7803e8db4a327b2e8e37903d174e54.poster.avif?t=1772569089\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/1c7803e8db4a327b2e8e37903d174e54.webm?t=1772569089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/1c7803e8db4a327b2e8e37903d174e54.mp4?t=1772569089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/f891ac9c8d481d8535f50e27d3dd147d.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/f891ac9c8d481d8535f50e27d3dd147d.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/78bc9c2b10f75161ab4a979e2e914de4.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/78bc9c2b10f75161ab4a979e2e914de4.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=428 /></span><strong><i><u></u></i></strong><br><br><br>In the game, <strong>Potato</strong>, a highly advanced alien robot with an <strong>unknown origin</strong>, steps out of a portal and appears right in front of you. Moments later, an <strong>alien invasion</strong> begins. Desperate, you start running, carrying this small and adorable robot. Luckily, it starts helping you fight off the enemies, and now you have no choice but to team up with it to face the invasion and return to your peaceful life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras/09aea00264743424554898146f348b31.avif?t=1772569089\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/extras_big/09aea00264743424554898146f348b31.avif?t=1772569089 width=800 height=428 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Boss Wave Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575500/544344a7dde95dd32c44fa51b4c078396f6b843f/header.jpg?t=1772569089","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3575500/1972472804/59f652b6fe66fa3b6f75002142da744ff174128c/1759432568/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759433155","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamst